{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"title":[{"Plain":"晶体"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"晶体"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"代数几何","text":"代数几何"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>概形 $X$ 上的晶体是一种可沿 $X$ 上的 “无穷小路径” "},{"Local":{"url":"平行移动","text":"平行移动"}},{"Plain":"的结构, 且满足余圈条件, 即平行移动一圈等于不动.</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>定义"},{"Local":{"url":"导出概形","text":"导出概形"}},{"Plain":" $X$ 上的晶体为其 "},{"Local":{"url":"deRham空间","text":"de Rham 空间"}},{"Plain":"上的"},{"Local":{"url":"拟凝聚层","text":"拟凝聚层"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}